<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69649" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναί</span></b> , Adv., used to express strong
		affirmation, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yea, verily</i>,
			in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> mostly folld. by 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δή, ν. δὴ ταῦτά γε πάντα . . κατὰ
					μοῖραν ἔειπες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.286
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. μήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					76.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. μάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					27.27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. μέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.151
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. μέντοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Astr.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			: used alone, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὲ κρίνω, ν. σέ</span>
			<i>yea</i> thee, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1445
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκρίνασθαι ν. ἢ οὔ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Top.</u>
					158a16
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ε̄ οὐκ ἔστι χαρακτηριστικὸν . . ,
					τὸ δὲ ᾱ ναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Choerob.
					<u>in Theod.</u>
					2.85
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> freq. in
			oaths, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. μά</span>
			<i>yea by</i> . . , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μά; ν.</span>
			 alone, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. τὰν Κόραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					1438
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				534
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. τὸν Ποτιδᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					81
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. τὼ σιώ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.4.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. πρὸς θεῶν ἀρήξατ</span>'
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1277
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in answers,
				<i>yes</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτ᾽ ἐτήτυμον</span>;
			Answ. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					738
				</span></i>
			 (troch.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				845
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				193a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Grg.</u>
				448b
			</span></i>, etc.; doubled, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1468
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1.56
			</span></i> P., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				5.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν.</span> folld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλά</span>, etc., to mark a qualified assent,
			<i>yes</i>, but . . , <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.84
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν., κατὰ σχολήν γε ἴσως: οὐ
			μήν</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				226e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				415e
			</span></i>.</div>
